     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Wednesday, June 24, 2015 at 9:16:06 PM UTC-4, Winston Chang wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">You can do it with a conditionalPanel. For example:<div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;overflow:visible!important\"><pre style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.8999996185303px;line-height:1.45;overflow:auto;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;font-stretch:normal;padding:16px;border-radius:3px;word-wrap:normal;word-break:normal;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">library(<span>shiny</span>)\r\nlibrary(<span>shinydashboard</span>)\r\n\r\n<span>ui</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> dashboardPage(\r\n  dashboardHeader(),\r\n  dashboardSidebar(\r\n    sidebarMenu(<span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">id</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>sidebarmenu<span>&quot;</span></span>,\r\n      menuItem(<span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>A<span>&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">tabName</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>a<span>&quot;</span></span>,  <span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">icon</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> icon(<span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>group<span>&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">lib</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>font-awesome<span>&quot;</span></span>)),\r\n      menuItem(<span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>B<span>&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">tabName</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>b<span>&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">icon</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> icon(<span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>check-circle<span>&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">lib</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>font-awesome<span>&quot;</span></span>)),\r\n      conditionalPanel(<span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>input.sidebarmenu === &#39;b&#39;<span>&quot;</span></span>,\r\n        sliderInput(<span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>b<span>&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>Under sidebarMenu<span>&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(0,134,179)\">1</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(0,134,179)\">100</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(0,134,179)\">50</span>)\r\n      )\r\n    ),\r\n    sliderInput(<span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>x<span>&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>Outside of menu<span>&quot;</span></span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(0,134,179)\">1</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(0,134,179)\">100</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(0,134,179)\">50</span>)\r\n  ),\r\n  dashboardBody()\r\n)\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(121,93,163)\">server</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">function</span>(<span>input</span>, <span>output</span>) {}\r\n\r\nshinyApp(<span>ui</span>, <span>server</span>)</pre><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22.3999996185303px\"><br></div>For more information, please see <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shinydashboard/issues/28\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shinydashboard/issues/28&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398082243000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2b5EeYOWgwKC3LLejM_DeB\">https://github.com/rstudio/shinydashboard/issues/28</a>. (This is where I originally posted the app above.)<br><br>-Winston</div></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Sun, Jun 21, 2015 at 5:03 PM, Lalas <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">ahmed...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>Is it possible to insert a shiny input (such as SelectInput), under menuSubItem, such as it&#39;s only visible when the menuItem is selected, and affect the result displayed in the dashboardBody?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/70d5756e-5963-453a-af22-0c38b8e02493%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/70d5756e-5963-453a-af22-0c38b8e02493%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398082243000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3uL7kxPENy1uqS5QUnfRIG\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/70d5756e-5963-453a-af22-0c38b8e02493%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&